    "Build on last period's momentum by applying a small, deliberate progression to your main lifts — even adding 1 to 2.5 kg to a key compound movement is meaningful over time.",
    "Set a consistent training schedule for the next period and note which sessions you complete, so routine adherence can be evaluated alongside your strength data."
  ],
  "contextSummary": "Twelve sets logged across chest, back, and legs with balanced volume, but no strength index data was captured this period, making overload assessment impossible — logging lift numbers is the top priority next period."
}
